WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — prov-dramabox-42000023968 — Episode 2 — English subtitles
NOTE Transcribed 2026-11-27 from the real episode audio (faster-whisper small).

1
00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:17.860
What the hell?

2
00:00:17.860 --> 00:00:23.420
Well, look who crawled out of her own coffin.

3
00:00:23.420 --> 00:00:27.420
Those three bottom tier losers are still sitting down there unwanted.

4
00:00:27.420 --> 00:00:29.420
Go on Sylvia, pick from the scraps.

5
00:00:29.420 --> 00:00:39.780
Come on, let's go pick those scraps!

6
00:00:39.780 --> 00:00:51.550
They're all pretty hot. How am I supposed to just pick one?

7
00:00:51.550 --> 00:00:55.550
So now you are being picky? Don't say I didn't warn you.

8
00:00:55.550 --> 00:00:59.550
If you don't claim a beast mate today, you'll be executed.

9
00:00:59.550 --> 00:01:01.550
Yeah, executed!

10
00:01:01.550 --> 00:01:06.280
Fine. Then I'll claim...

11
00:01:06.280 --> 00:01:11.280
Great. The Obsidian Empire has a princess who looks older than the Empress herself.

12
00:01:11.280 --> 00:01:14.280
She looks gentle? I hope she picks me!

13
00:01:14.280 --> 00:01:17.280
Keep staring at me, old woman, and I'll gouge your eyes out!

14
00:01:17.280 --> 00:01:24.560
How pathetic. Your own people despise you, and now even captured beast folk are rejecting you.

15
00:01:24.560 --> 00:01:29.560
Great. One looks like he's dying, one looks like he wants to kill me,

16
00:01:29.560 --> 00:01:32.560
and one looks like he might cry if I blink too hard.

17
00:01:32.560 --> 00:01:34.560
Genetic scan completed.

18
00:01:34.560 --> 00:01:39.560
Wait, what? Who said that? Who's this?

19
00:01:39.560 --> 00:01:45.120
Am I the only one who can see this floating screen?

20
00:01:45.120 --> 00:01:50.120
Host Sylvia, successfully bound. Affinity system activated.

21
00:01:50.120 --> 00:01:53.120
What? An Affinity system?
